          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes Asmaan different from other energy drinks?",
            "answer": "<p>Asmaan was built as a working drink rather than a stimulant. The caffeine comes from green coffee instead of a synthesised powder, paired with L-theanine and KSM-66 ashwagandha.</p>"
